ations\\nretrieval gaps               — Show unresolved retrieval knowledge gaps\\nretrieval inspect            — Inspect topic-specific retrieval mastery, gaps, and lineage\\nretrieval lineage            — Show retrieval/document/episode lineage chain\\nretrieval mastery            — Show topic mastery progression and confidence evolution\\nretrieval reflections        — Show retrieval-linked reflection/evaluation context\\nretrieval sources            — Show governed source reliability scoring\\nretrieval status             — Show adaptive retrieval runtime telemetry and cognition status (aliases: memory-retrieval status, adaptive-retrieval status, cognition-retrieval status)\\nruntime capabilities         — Enumerate canonical runtime capabilities with authority and availability\\nnotifications                — Router capability family for 'notifications'\\n\\n--- SEC MEMBRANE ---\\nsec-membrane                 — Router capability family for 'sec-membrane'\\n\\n--- SECURITY ---\\nsecurity                     — Router capability family for 'security'\\n\\n--- SELF ---\\nself enhance                 — Router capability family for 'self enhance'\\n\\n--- SELF ENHANCE ---\\nself-enhance                 — Router capability family for 'self-enhance'\\n\\n--- SELF HEAL ---\\nself-heal                    — Router capability family for 'self-heal'\\n\\n--- SELF MONITOR ---\\nself-monitor                 — Router capability family for 'self-monitor'\\n\\n--- SHOW ---\\nshow improvements            — Router capability family for 'show improvements'\\nshow new commands            — Router capability family for 'show new commands'\\n\\n--- SHUTDOWN ---\\nshutdown                     — Router capability family for 'shutdown'\\n\\n--- SLSA ---\\nrestart_slsa                 — Restart SLSA with an updated topic list\\nslsa-status                  — Show SLSA engine running state and last artifact built\\nstart_slsa                   — Start SLSA knowledge-artifact generation (op